<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">C.点我隐藏</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>项目具有认知危害和信息危害，人类将项目穿上、认知项目以及描述项目的行为均会使自身受到精神影响，具体表现为在需要做出有3个以上选项的抉择时，将会明显地倾向于选择第3个选项。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>被Dr.Coldmist于██服饰店以£9.15的价格购得。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于Site-CN-██低价值物品收容柜。</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00374" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00374" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00374-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6439634&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606184788" alt="Coldmist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6439634)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/coldmist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6439634); return false;">Coldmist</a></span></p>
